---
export const title = 'Usage';
export const order = 100;
import DemoComponentCard from '../../../../components/DemoComponentCard.astro';
---

<p>
  <code>wc-user-menu</code> is the account menu at the end of an app bar. The avatar button, from
  <code>name</code> and <code>src</code>, is named "Account menu for <em>name</em>". The menu
  starts with a header (<code>name</code>, <code>email</code> and an optional presence
  <code>status</code>: <code>online</code>, <code>away</code>, <code>busy</code> or
  <code>offline</code>), then your <code>wc-menu-item</code>s. Items in the <code>footer</code>
  slot, such as Sign out, come last.
</p>

<DemoComponentCard lang={'html'}>
  <wc-user-menu name='Ada Lovelace' email='ada@example.com' status='online'>
    <wc-menu-item><wc-icon slot='start' name='person'></wc-icon>Profile</wc-menu-item>
    <wc-menu-item><wc-icon slot='start' name='settings'></wc-icon>Settings</wc-menu-item>
    <wc-divider slot='footer'></wc-divider>
    <wc-menu-item slot='footer'><wc-icon slot='start' name='logout'></wc-icon>Sign out</wc-menu-item>
  </wc-user-menu>
</DemoComponentCard>
